{"id":439,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"全人教育で知性と品性を育てる清真学園","feature_description":"清真学園は、師弟同行と全人教育を掲げ、生徒の意欲を高めながら学ぶ力を深める学校です。教育方針では自立心、敬愛奉仕、国際的視野を重視しており、学校生活では部活動が大きな位置を占めます。学びと活動の両輪で、心身ともに成長できる環境が整っています。部活動の種類も幅広く、学習と活動を両立しながら個性を伸ばせます。個人の関心に沿って挑戦しやすく、部活動が学校生活の中心になっています。","clubs":[{"id":8583,"name":"剣道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.seishin-web.jp/school_life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":8584,"name":"野球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.seishin-web.jp/school_life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":8585,"name":"ラグビーフットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.seishin-web.jp/school_life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":8586,"name":"サッカー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.seishin-web.jp/school_life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":8587,"name":"バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.seishin-web.jp/school_life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":8588,"name":"バドミントン部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.seishin-web.jp/school_life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":8589,"name":"テニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.seishin-web.jp/school_life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":8590,"name":"卓球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.seishin-web.jp/school_life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":8591,"name":"弓道部（中学）","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.seishin-web.jp/school_life/club/kyudo-m/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":8592,"name":"弓道部（高校）","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.seishin-web.jp/school_life/club/kyudo-h/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":8593,"name":"野球部（中学）","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.seishin-web.jp/school_life/club/baseball-m/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":8594,"name":"野球部（高校）","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.seishin-web.jp/school_life/club/baseball-h/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":8595,"name":"バスケットボール部（高校）","category":